        "image_text_8KT6Ui": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><strong>Bought the wrong bag?</strong></p><p>You can return or exchange your order within 28 days of purchase, provided the item is unused, has tags attached, and includes the original receipt and packaging.</p><p>Returns and exchanges can be made at a Crumpler store or through our Returns Portal. Orders purchased in-store and paid for with cash are only eligible for return or exchange in-store and cannot be processed through our online Returns Portal.</p><p><strong>To start your return or exchange:</strong></p><p>- Go to our <a href=\"https://crumplerau.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://crumplerau.loopreturns.com/#/\">Returns Portal</a>.<br/>- Select your return outcome.<br/>- Your prepaid return label will be sent to the email address used on your order.<br/>- Print the label and carefully follow the return instructions.</p><p>If you need help with your return, please contact our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">Customer Care</a> team.</p><p><strong>Exchanges</strong><br/><br/>We offer instant exchanges for Australian customers. This means your replacement order is sent out immediately, so you do not have to wait for your original item(s) to be returned to our warehouse. To enable this, an authorisation hold for the value of the returning item(s) will be placed on your card and released once your return has been received.</p><p><strong>Return labels</strong><br/><br/>Return labels are available through our Returns Portal. Customers are responsible for the cost of the label, which will be deducted from the total refund amount. Domestic labels can be printed at home or at an Australia Post Office using the QR code provided.</p><p><strong>Return label cost</strong><br/><br/>$12.80 AUD</p><p><strong>Important information</strong><br/><br/>Multiple orders cannot be returned under a single return request or in the same box. Each order must be submitted separately and returned with its own return label.</p><p>Once your return is received at our warehouse, please allow up to 3 business days for processing. After the returned item has been quality checked and approved, your refund will be issued to the original method of payment and a confirmation email will be sent. While refunds are processed by Crumpler within 3 business days, your financial institution may require additional time to complete the transaction.</p><p>If returned merchandise does not pass the quality check, Crumpler reserves the right to withhold the refund and retain the returned merchandise.</p><p><strong>Damaged or defective goods</strong><br/><br/>If you believe you have received a defective or damaged item, or an item different from the one you ordered, please contact our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">Customer Care</a> team.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_text_hCyPaB": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Orders are dispatched from our warehouse in Australia. Orders are shipped within 24-48 hours, Monday to Friday. All domestic orders are shipped via Australia Post. If you have any tracking-related queries after your order has been dispatched, please contact the courier directly.<br/><br/>All delivery times are an estimate provided by our couriers*  <br/><br/><strong>Australia Delivery:<br/></strong>Australia Post Standard: 2-6 business days from dispatch. <br/>Australia Post Express: 1-3 business days from dispatch.<br/><br/>Domestic Orders More Than $100: Free<br/>Domestic Orders Less Than $100: $10<br/>Domestic Express Shipping: $15AUD<br/><br/><strong>Liability:<br/></strong>We are not liable for packages lost or damaged in transit with our postage partners. We will do our best to assist you by contacting our couriers to investigate any issues with your delivery. However we are not liable to refund any lost, damaged or stolen packages. For all enquiries, please contact us <a href=\"https://www.crumpler.com/pages/contact\" title=\"contact\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
